1
00:00:04,690 --> 00:00:10,380
Hmm. I definitely think that the Bishop form
is the most troublesome in the Triaina combo.

2
00:00:10,730 --> 00:00:16,500
Unlike the Knight and Rook, the Bishop
form needs time to charge the blast.

3
00:00:17,030 --> 00:00:19,700
And I doubt our opponents
will just sit around and wait.

4
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:29,040
We'll need teamwork to overcome the problem.

5
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:34,170
True. If the team buys me time,
I won't have to actively evade

6
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:36,820
and I can get a better shot.

7
00:00:38,050 --> 00:00:41,680
But, the amount of energy I expend
with the Triaina is no joke.

8
00:00:42,270 --> 00:00:45,270
I may or may not be able to
get two or three shots in.

9
00:00:45,270 --> 00:00:48,190
If we're going to use it,
it'll have to be on Sairaorg directly.

10
00:00:48,190 --> 00:00:49,940
Yeah, you're right.

