Nice to meet you as well.

7516
00:18:14,780 --> 00:18:19,530
I apologize for meeting you
for the first time in such a way.

7517
00:18:19,910 --> 00:18:22,700
N-Not at all. Did you have business with me?

7518
00:18:23,120 --> 00:18:27,080
Yes, I thought I would at least
send my greetings to you.

7519
00:18:27,080 --> 00:18:29,710
I should have come in person
for our first meeting, but...

7520
00:18:30,130 --> 00:18:34,460
Auntie, please do not worry yourself.
Your feelings are enough.

7521
00:18:34,960 --> 00:18:35,970
Thank you.

7522
00:18:36,800 --> 00:18:41,390
And, Hyoudou Issei. Please take
good care of my daughter.

7523
00:18:41,720 --> 00:18:44,430
Huh? Yes, of course.

7524
00:18:44,430 --> 00:18:46,270
Though, the President is here.

7525
00:18:46,270 --> 00:18:49,100
And many people in our club are better
at looking after people than me.

7526
00:18:49,520 --> 00:18:51,110
Yes. It's just...

7527
00:18:51,110 --> 00:18:56,400
Please protect her from any
strange insects of the human world.

7528
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:58,070
Strange insects?

7529
00:18:58,610 --> 00:19:03,910
If the Red Dragon Emperor,
who has distinguished himself many times,

7530
00:19:03,910 --> 00:19:08,080
stays by her side, my husband
and I will feel more at ease.

7531
00:19:08,250 --> 00:19:09,540
We can also hope for good news.

7532
00:19:10,750 --> 00:19:14,750
I understand. If that's the case,
I will protect your daughter!

7533
00:19:16,300 --> 00:19:17,880
Thank you very much.

7534
00:19:18,340 --> 00:19:21,700
Ravel, you know what to do, right?

7535
00:19:22,220 --> 00:19:26,140
Stand behind Rias and listen to her well.

7536
00:19:26,140 --> 00:19:29,100
Work hard to not sully our name.

7537
00:19:29,560 --> 00:19:31,060
Of course!

7538
00:19:31,060 --> 00:19:34,400
On top of that, make sure
to get closer to Hyoudou Issei.

7539
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:36,940
Lastly...

7540
00:19:36,940 --> 00:19:38,030
Y-Yes?

7541
00:19:38,030 --> 00:19:41,320
I have heard that you wish to
become a high-ranking devil.

7542
00:19:41,320 --> 00:19:42,820
That's right.

7543
00:19:43,200 --> 00:19:46,770
My daughter is currently in my family.

7544
00:19:47,120 --> 00:19:48,950
I have traded her with Riser.

7545
00:19:49,500 --> 00:19:54,290
Listen well. My daughter is currently free.

7546
00:19:54,290 --> 00:19:55,170
Do you understand?

7547
00:19:55,170 --> 00:19:57,050
Yes, I understand!

7548
00:19:57,880 --> 00:19:59,630
I see. Good.

7549
00:20:00,220 --> 00:20:02,380
Well, then. Good day.

7550
00:20:12,980 --> 00:20:15,570
P-President? Where are you going?

7551
00:20:18,280 --> 00:20:22,090
Issei, will you protect me?

7552
00:20:24,030 --> 00:20:26,410
Of course I would protect you, President!

7553
00:20:27,030 --> 00:20:28,410
And Asia, too?

7554
00:20:28,410 --> 00:20:31,120
Huh? Yeah, I will protect Asia, too!

7555
00:20:31,660 --> 00:20:33,120
And Akeno?

7556
00:20:33,120 --> 00:20:35,850
Akeno? Of course!

7557
00:20:36,750 --> 00:20:39,830
But, what's going on?
Why are you suddenly asking?

7558
00:20:41,050 --> 00:20:42,550
Hey, Issei.

7559
00:20:43,130 --> 00:20:43,760
Yes?

7560
00:20:44,970 --> 00:20:47,720
What am I to you?

7561
00:20:48,430 --> 00:20:49,050
Huh?

7562
00:20:50,350 --> 00:20:51,510
What am I?!

7563
00:20:53,020 --> 00:20:57,060
Um, to me, President is President...

7564
00:20:57,270 --> 00:20:58,190
Stupid!

7565
00:21:03,780 --> 00:21:05,070
Big sister!

7566
00:21:05,570 --> 00:21:07,570
Issei! You're terrible!

7567
00:21:09,990 --> 00:21:12,710
That was pretty bad just now, Issei.

7568
00:21:13,870 --> 00:21:15,580
Bad? What do you mean?

7569
00:21:16,130 --> 00:21:17,920
Goodness, you...

7570
00:21:18,340 --> 00:21:21,380
Of course Rias and Asia would get angry.

7571
00:21:21,760 --> 00:21:25,590
Even I thought you were
pretty stupid there, Issei.

7572
00:21:25,590 --> 00:21:28,890
Goodness! You're really pathetic, Issei!

7573
00:21:29,600 --> 00:21:30,600
The worst.

7574
00:21:32,390 --> 00:21:33,270
Stop!

7575
00:21:33,270 --> 00:21:33,890
Huh?!

7576
00:21:34,350 --> 00:21:38,230
The way you are now,
you will just hurt her more.

7577
00:21:38,440 --> 00:21:39,570
Huh?

7578
00:21:39,570 --> 00:21:42,780
Hey, Gasper. Am I really that worthless?

7579
00:21:42,780 --> 00:21:45,150
Um... Yes. Very much so.

7580
00:21:47,570 --> 00:21:51,790
Um, it was the fault of my
mother and I, wasn't it?

7581
00:21:51,790 --> 00:21:54,540
Don't worry about it, Ravel.

7582
00:21:54,540 --> 00:22:00,590
It is Issei's fault for not
thinking of Rias until now.

7583
00:22:02,340 --> 00:22:04,340
What am I supposed to do?

